<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Kazuya Devil hellsweep Tekken 7</Major>
    <Description>Hello, Today I've brought something new. 
Kazuya one of the main characters of the tekken game series has many moves which are hard to perform, using this macro on keyran, you can simply easily use it. Just select &lt;&lt;While holding key&gt;&gt; for less likely chances to fail the hit and recover quickly! works when you are devil in t7. This does ENOURMOUS damage at the wall as a wall ender!

Use default key binds. 

Goodluck!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
